      "content": "Wait, why do you think Witness A is more \"solid\"? I mean, both of them saw the same thing, right? Is it just because of how they were acting/dressed? Like, does the fact that Witness A is an older professional man vs Witness B being a younger guy in a hoodie actually matter in a legal sense if the facts they reported are basically the same?",
